      "message": "my bias is that this means that every transfer requires a _native_ heap allocation and free :-) but, yeah, without stats it\u0027s hard to know.\n\nsince this is the same as the other existing code, i\u0027ll +2 as \"better than what\u0027s currently there\", even if it\u0027s possible it\u0027s not the optimal choice.",
